    "detailed_description": "Resttore is an open world action adventure game with survival mechanics where you play as Sashi, a masked figure with no memory who wakes up in an unknown place and has to help its inhabitants to restore peace and harmony. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760920/extras/f878fa21f54b12072d496f7909195700.avif?t=1704501578\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2>Explore a fantastic open world full of secrets, puzzles, enemies and charismatic characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT</h2>Defeat all kinds of dangerous and not so dangerous enemies to create a safer place for you and others.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT</h2>Gather useful resources to create better items that help you complete your objectives.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2>Build your own house to take shelter from the dangers of the night and prepare for future challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX</h2>Enjoy the beautiful views and experience side activities and mini-games of all kinds.<br><br><br>",
